{#
    Item Meta Description -- the meta description of an item detail page.

    Hands over the item's own text the way a CMS page excerpt does - tags stripped, whitespace collapsed - so every
    item type describes itself alike; page_description() cuts it to the snippet. Without text it prints the line the
    caller built from the item's fields.

    Used in:    books / films / boardgames / dishes detail pages
    Parameters:
        - text (string, optional)     -- the item's own description; default: none
        - fallback (string, required) -- the line naming the item, printed when text is empty
#}
{%- set plain = (text|default('')|replace({'<': ' <'})|striptags|u).collapseWhitespace() -%}
{{- plain.isEmpty() ? fallback : plain -}}
